    {
        "text": "Those damn whitemasks... Why do they always show up at the worst times?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Worthless scum, all of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't even have the right to challenge us for the treasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haaah? What are you talking about? This has long been our turn, so you'd better get lost, or else!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
